# Product map

`Platform → Community (URL + field schema) → Group (chat room) → User`

| Role | V1 can | Cannot |
|------|--------|--------|
| Platform admin | Onboard communities; seed early schemas | Invent a billing console |
| Community admin | Admit/verify; create groups; this community’s fields | Other communities |
| Group admin | Members, sticky, calendar, settings, delete any post, F1 | Other groups |
| User | Chat, profile, search this community, albums, notes/stars, leave | Create groups; see notes about them |
| Unapproved | AD: profile + DM admin | A1 |

**V1 loop:** community URL AA → Join/Login → AD until admitted → A1 → DM/group or profile search → profile → DM.

Success = Wire-fast on a phone. 100 concurrent now; thousands later. Isolation bugs are privacy bugs.
